          {
            "title": "True",
            "id": 62115,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [
              {
                "id": "41d560a0-322c-4422-b428-caf11623cc72"
              }
            ],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><img src=\"41d560a0-322c-4422-b428-caf11623cc72\" visible-if=\"always\" /><p>Há um valor especial que <em>não é</em> uma string <em>nem</em> um número: <code>true</code>.</p><p>Não há aspas em torno dele, e não é um valor numérico.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Displaying true",
            "id": 62052,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>true</code> é ótimo para situações como verificar se um interruptor está ligado ou se um recurso está habilitado.</p><p>Exiba <code>true</code> no console.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Allow updates&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"46\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Allow updates\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"true\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>true</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Saving true ",
            "id": 62050,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Podemos armazenar <code>true</code> em uma variável assim como uma string ou um número.</p><p>Armazene <code>true</code> em uma variável e exiba no console.</p><code version=\"2\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" correct = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(correct);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"20\" /><option startIndex=\"34\" endIndex=\"41\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"true\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>true</code> seguido de <code>correct</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Podemos armazenar <code>true</code> em uma variável assim como uma string ou um número.</p><p>Crie uma variável chamada <code>enabled</code> para uma configuração ativada e exiba seu valor especial no console.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"enabled\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".\" /><text value=\"log\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"enabled\" /><text value=\")\" /><text value=\";\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"13\" /><option startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"20\" /><option startIndex=\"34\" endIndex=\"41\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"false\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;true&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"disabled\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"true\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>enabled</code> seguido de <code>true</code> e finalmente <code>enabled</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "False",
            "id": 62049,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [
              {
                "id": "581c9bf2-4254-41a8-babe-529b2f7e4feb"
              }
            ],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><img src=\"581c9bf2-4254-41a8-babe-529b2f7e4feb\" visible-if=\"always\" /><p><code>false</code> é outro valor especial e o oposto de <code>true</code>. Podemos usá-lo como <code>true</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Displaying false",
            "id": 62048,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Salve o valor <code>false</code> na variável <code>status</code> e exiba <code>status</code> no console.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Device charged&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" status = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(status);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"46\" endIndex=\"51\" /><option startIndex=\"65\" endIndex=\"71\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"var\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Device charged\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"false\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>false</code> seguido de <code>status</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Mantenha a primeira mensagem, use <code>charged</code> para armazenar o valor especial de um dispositivo sem carga e exiba-o.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".\" /><text value=\"log\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Device charged&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"charged\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".\" /><text value=\"log\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"charged\" /><text value=\")\" /><text value=\";\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"37\" endIndex=\"44\" /><option startIndex=\"47\" endIndex=\"52\" /><option startIndex=\"66\" endIndex=\"73\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"true\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;false&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"status\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Device charged\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"false\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>charged</code> seguido de <code>false</code> e finalmente <code>charged</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 1",
            "id": 62132,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Qual é um bom uso para os valores <code>true</code> e <code>false</code>? </p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item correct=\"true\" value=\"1\">Mostrando se um recurso está ativado ou desativado</item><item correct=\"false\" value=\"2\">Armazenando valores de um a cinco</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Mostrando se um recurso está ativado ou desativado.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Você precisa registrar se a reprodução automática está ativada ou desativada. Qual opção representa diretamente esses dois estados?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Os valores especiais <code>true</code> e <code>false</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Um número de um a cinco</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Uma string que contém o nome do recurso</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Os valores especiais <code>true</code> e <code>false</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 2",
            "id": 62134,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Por que <code>false</code> não é uma string?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" autoPlay = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Não há aspas ao redor disso</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Está armazenado dentro de uma variável</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Não há aspas ao redor disso.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Você adiciona aspas ao redor de <code>false</code> no código exibido. O que muda?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" autoPlay = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>autoPlay</code> armazena uma string em vez do valor especial <code>false</code>.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">O valor armazenado não muda porque as letras continuam iguais.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Ele exibe <code>false</code> no console em vez de armazenar um valor.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>autoPlay</code> armazena uma string em vez do valor especial <code>false</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 3",
            "id": 62133,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Escolha a melhor opção para mostrar que um usuário cancelou a assinatura de um serviço.</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>const subscribed = false;</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>const subscribed = true;</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>const subscribed = false;</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Um usuário cancelou uma assinatura. Qual declaração registra esse estado corretamente?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>const subscribed = false;</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>const subscribed = true;</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>const subscribed = \"false\";</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>const subscribed = false;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 4",
            "id": 62135,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Por que <code>\"false\"</code> não é o mesmo que <code>false</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Há aspas ao redor, então <code>\"false\"</code> é uma string</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>\"false\"</code> e <code>false</code> são iguais</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Há aspas ao redor, então <code>\"false\"</code> é uma string.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Você tem os valores <code>true</code> e <code>\"false\"</code>. Qual alteração transforma os dois em strings?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Adicione aspas ao redor de <code>true</code> e mantenha <code>\"false\"</code> igual.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Remova as aspas de <code>\"false\"</code> e mantenha <code>true</code> igual.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Adicione aspas a <code>true</code> e remova as aspas de <code>\"false\"</code>.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Adicione aspas ao redor de <code>true</code> e mantenha <code>\"false\"</code> igual.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example 1",
            "id": 62203,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Mostre o status da configuração de atualização automática exibindo <code>false</code> no console.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\"><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Auto update&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"28\" endIndex=\"35\" /><option startIndex=\"35\" endIndex=\"36\" /><option startIndex=\"36\" endIndex=\"39\" /><option startIndex=\"39\" endIndex=\"40\" /><option startIndex=\"40\" endIndex=\"45\" /><option startIndex=\"45\" endIndex=\"46\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Auto update\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"false\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>console</code> seguido de <code>.</code> e depois <code>log</code>, <code>(</code>, <code>false</code>, <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Mantenha a primeira mensagem. Exiba o valor especial <code>true</code> ou <code>false</code> que significa que a atualização automática está desativada.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".\" /><text value=\"log\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Auto update&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".\" /><text value=\"log\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\")\" /><text value=\";\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"28\" endIndex=\"35\" /><option startIndex=\"35\" endIndex=\"36\" /><option startIndex=\"36\" endIndex=\"39\" /><option startIndex=\"39\" endIndex=\"40\" /><option startIndex=\"40\" endIndex=\"45\" /><option startIndex=\"45\" endIndex=\"46\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"true\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"alert\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;false&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Auto update\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"false\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>console</code> seguido de <code>.</code>, <code>log</code>, <code>(</code>, <code>false</code> e finalmente <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example 2",
            "id": 62204,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Crie a variável <code>autoSaveImage</code> e armazene <code>true</code> dentro dela.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" autoSaveImage = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"19\" /><option startIndex=\"22\" endIndex=\"26\" /><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"5\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>const</code> seguido de <code>autoSaveImage</code> e finalmente <code>true</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Declare uma configuração chamada <code>autoSaveImage</code> que esteja ativada.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" autoSaveImage = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"5\" /><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"19\" /><option startIndex=\"22\" endIndex=\"26\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"let\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"false\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;true&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>const</code> seguido de <code>autoSaveImage</code> e finalmente <code>true</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example 3",
            "id": 62205,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Evite cookies criando a variável e armazenando <code>false</code> nela.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" allowCookies = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"18\" /><option startIndex=\"21\" endIndex=\"26\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;false&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>allowCookies</code> seguido de <code>false</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Declare <code>allowCookies</code> de modo que os cookies não sejam permitidos.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"allowCookies\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"5\" /><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"18\" /><option startIndex=\"21\" endIndex=\"26\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"let\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"true\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;false&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>const</code> seguido de <code>allowCookies</code> e finalmente <code>false</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example 4",
            "id": 62206,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Ajuste as configurações de reprodução automática codificando <code>true</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" autoPlay = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"21\" /></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>true</code>.</p></body></html>"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": 7162,
        "title": "Negando Valores",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "True to false",
            "id": 62046,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [
              {
                "id": "c36a47d0-0c24-47c9-ad61-1010d797bdce"
              }
            ],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><img src=\"c36a47d0-0c24-47c9-ad61-1010d797bdce\" visible-if=\"always\" /><p>Um sinal de <code>!</code> na frente de <code>true</code> faz com que a expressão resulte em <code>false</code>. Se algo não é verdadeiro, tem que ser falso.</p><p>O sinal <code>!</code> é o <strong>operador de negação</strong>. Ele transforma valores em seu <strong>oposto</strong>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Change true to false",
            "id": 62047,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quando mudamos um valor para o seu oposto com <code>!</code>, nós o negamos.</p><p>Coloque um sinal de <code>!</code> antes de <code>true</code> para mudar seu valor.</p><code version=\"2\" name=\"script.js\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(!\" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"13\" /><option startIndex=\"13\" endIndex=\"17\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"false\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>!</code> seguido de <code>true</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quando mudamos um valor para o seu oposto com <code>!</code>, nós o negamos.</p><p>Negue uma vez o valor especial <code>true</code> ou <code>false</code> para o console exibir <code>false</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(!\" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"13\" /><option startIndex=\"13\" endIndex=\"17\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"false\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;true&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"false\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>!</code> seguido de <code>true</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Change false to true",
            "id": 62044,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O operador <code>!</code> antes de <code>false</code> também altera seu valor. Se um valor não é <code>false</code>, ele tem que ser <code>true</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" name=\"script.js\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(!\" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"13\" /><option startIndex=\"13\" endIndex=\"18\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"true\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>!</code> seguido de <code>false</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O operador <code>!</code> antes de <code>false</code> também altera seu valor. Se um valor não é <code>false</code>, ele tem que ser <code>true</code>.</p><p>Use a negação para fazer o console exibir <code>true</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(!\" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"13\" /><option startIndex=\"13\" endIndex=\"18\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"true\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"!!\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;false&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"true\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>!</code> seguido de <code>false</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Negate variables",
            "id": 62040,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Podemos usar o operador <code>!</code> com variáveis para negar os valores que elas armazenam.</p><code version=\"2\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" isMorning = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(!isMorning);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"36\" endIndex=\"37\" /><option startIndex=\"37\" endIndex=\"46\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"false\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>!</code> seguido de <code>isMorning</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Podemos usar o operador <code>!</code> com variáveis para negar os valores que elas armazenam.</p><p>Armazene que é de manhã e depois faça o console mostrar que a manhã acabou.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" isMorning = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(!isMorning);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"22\" /><option startIndex=\"36\" endIndex=\"37\" /><option startIndex=\"37\" endIndex=\"46\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"false\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"isEvening\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"!!\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"false\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>true</code> seguido de <code>!</code> e finalmente <code>isMorning</code>.</p></body></html>",
