          {
            "title": "Question 2",
            "id": 62210,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Por que este código exibe <code>false</code> no console?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" latestVersion = !\" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(latestVersion);\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"false\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">O operador <code>!</code> na frente de <code>true</code> transforma seu valor em false</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">As variáveis sempre aparecem como <code>false</code> no console</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">O operador <code>!</code> na frente de <code>true</code> transforma seu valor em false.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O console exibe <code>latestVersion</code>. Por que a saída é <code>false</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" latestVersion = !\" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(latestVersion);\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"false\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">A atribuição nega <code>true</code> antes de armazenar o resultado.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">O console transforma todas as variáveis Boolean em <code>false</code>.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">O nome da variável faz o valor representar uma versão antiga.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">A atribuição nega <code>true</code> antes de armazenar o resultado.</p></body></html>"
