            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Avalie a expressão do lado direito da atribuição. Qual valor é armazenado em <code>result</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result = !\" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>false</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>true</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">A string <code>\"false\"</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>false</code>.</p></body></html>"
